  PROVO→PARISSALT LAKE CITY PROVO

  No the plane didn't fly from Provo to Paris, then back to Salt lake. Route was
  on 4/18 Cairo-Paris..

  4/19paris to Goose Bay. Goose Bay to SLC..SLC to Provo. Then sat there until
  12July

  CAIRO →PARIS→WILLISTON→PROVO

  Acc 4/22-23. Williston code XWA

